OL,3,AGerman police arrest suspected power
OL,4,Agrid saboteur after manhunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 48-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of carrying out a spate of
OL,8,Fsabotage attacks on Germany's
OL,9,Felectricity grid after spending several
OL,10,Fdays on the run.
OL,12,FThe suspect was carrying explosives
OL,13,Fwhen he was detained near the
OL,14,FWeisweiler power plant in western
OL,15,FGermany on Tuesday, police in Cologne
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FA tent in nearby undergrowth was also
OL,19,Ffound to be rigged with further
OL,20,Fexplosives, they added.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
